 "remarks": "Put on a record. Settle in. Enjoy the views and let the green space work its magic. Unit 481 is moody in the best way. This first-floor corner unit brings the outside in, with big windows framing the treed courtyard from nearly every room. The whole place feels like a deep breath. Warm wood floors run from the entry foyer through the living room and into the dining area. There is real room to spread out and relax. The galley kitchen pairs solid maple cabinetry with granite counters and recessed lighting. Step out to the patio for coffee under the canopy. The bedroom suite is a true retreat, with two double closets and private full bath. The bonus room does double duty for guests or a home office. There's a powder room off the hall and laundry in the unit. The updates are done: new air conditioners (2025), filtered drinking water (2025), a new oven (2023) and a washer/dryer (2021). Heat and hot water are included in the common charges. Your January self will thank you. One vehicle per driver + 2 guest passes. Reserved spaces are available if medically required. Rolling Ridge is a beautifully maintained Tudor-style complex. Summer means pool days. The rest of the year brings platform tennis and the dog park. A private storage unit in Building J is included, and fiber-optic internet is available. Tucked away, yet minutes from the Merritt, I-95 and Route 7. Beautifully maintained, move right in end enjoy. Easy livin', zen vibes.",
